WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.875
Join together, break apart, or swap places: three patterns of reaction.

2
00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:09.102
Zinc atoms, and copper oxide particles.

3
00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:13.952
Zinc is more reactive than copper, so it takes the oxygen.

4
00:00:14.552 --> 00:00:18.027
Copper is left on its own: displaced by the zinc.

5
00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:24.052
Joining is synthesis, breaking apart is decomposition, swapping is displacement.
